{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1486376-looking-for-prompts-to-test-ai-that-draws-chronicles-of-darkness-content","id":1486376,"title":"Looking for prompts to test AI that draws Chronicles of Darkness content","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-07-13T17:05:56-07:00","id":1486376,"title":"Looking for prompts to test AI that draws Chronicles of Darkness content","content":"So I put together something that uses a specially trained GPT-3 and DALL-E to take text prompts and turn them into CofD-style art. It's not groundbreaking but maybe it's a little better than the freely available stuff out there in a roughly consistent dark urban fantasy style.<br /> <br /> Some examples of resulting artworks: <a href=\"https://imgur.com/a/kZrUm7B\" target=\"_blank\">https://imgur.com/a/kZrUm7B</a><br /> <br /> Right now, even the input is more or less randomly generated, but I'd love to test it out on some actual prompts. If you have any CofD content you'd like to see drawn, please post it here and I'll see what comes out.<br /> <br /> There are some restrictions imposed by cost or provider:<ul><li>Keep your prompts &lt; 400 words (I pay per word, more or less :P)</li> <li>The language model has been tuned on work from VtR, MtAw, WtF, and CtL. So you can write something like 'a tall Mastigos' and it will 'understand' it's a mage.</li> <li>The goal is to capture the 'gist' or 'essence' of the prompt, so some details might [will] get automatically omitted or simplified for the sake of producing a good art prompt.</li> <li>For characters, if you don't specify race gender and age, the AI is probably going to draw a white man in their late 20s/early 30s (unless their name implies a different race/gender)</li> <li>The language model was designed to draw human-ish characters but you can use it to draw other things like artifacts, landscapes, animals, etc.</li> <li>Until DALL-E is released to the public, you're highly limited in how many artworks you're allowed to generate so I can't guarantee I'll fill every request but I'll revisit this thread periodically</li> <li>I'm not yet allowed to publish the language model or any DALL-E based app but will as soon as I'm allowed to.</li> </ul>Thanks in advance for the prompts. Looking forward to what you come up with.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My ideas are bad and I should feel bad.","edited":{"userid":12157,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12157-kvark","user":"Kvark","date":". 07-13-2022, 08:11 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12157-kvark","name":"Kvark","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"186"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-13T20:48:23-07:00","id":1486383,"title":"","content":"A young blonde male Moros mage with a scar on the face from the 20's, eyes of a snake and really feeling lost on Paris, France. [26 words as a first attemp (?]","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27384-altidiya","name":"altidiya","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27384_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-13T21:53:43-07:00","id":1486386,"title":"","content":"A male Acanthus using cargo pants with High Speech embroidery walks down a street in Vancouver, the farther half of which looks to have gone back in time 200 years, the boundary between these halves showing fractal patterns.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font o