057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":27258,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","user":"Cauthon","date":". 07-26-2022, 07:26 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-26T07:22:14-07:00","id":1488017,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cauthon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1486376-looking-for-prompts-to-test-ai-that-draws-chronicles-of-darkness-content?p=1487997#post1487997\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">These are awesome, thanks for doing them!<br /> <br /> If you don't mind, could you do this?<br /> <br /> A bald, gangly Mastigos with a short beard, the shadow of his Name looming behind him.<br /> <br /> A sad-faced Beast Chatelaine with a gun-like wand in her hand. She wears Police riot gear that is far too large for her, given that she's clearly in middle school.</div> </div> </div> </div>Your Mastigos: <a href=\"https://imgur.com/a/vwgAekn\" target=\"_blank\">https://imgur.com/a/vwgAekn</a><br /> <br /> I can't fill your second request for two reasons: (1) my language model was not tuned on Beast so it doesn't have any clue how to translate beast specific terminology into a prompt to be drawn. (2) DALL-E specifically detects and rejects any attempts to deliberately draw guns or gun violence.<br /> <br /> Also, following up on my last message, because it entered beta anyone can go to labs.openai.com and take a whack at coming up with prompts to draw their own characters. It costs about USD 0.15 per image, though. I don't personally know what a Beast Chatelaine is or else I'd try to do it for you manually, or if you can describe it in non-Beast-specific terminology and with no guns I can run it through for you <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My ideas are bad and I should feel bad.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12157-kvark","name":"Kvark","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"186"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-26T07:27:57-07:00","id":1488019,"title":"","content":"OK I have to share this for the humor of it. I dropped the gun wand part and just had it go through to see what would come out...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://imgur.com/a/tcn1LD6\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://imgur.com/a/tcn1LD6\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://imgur.com/a/tcn1LD6\" target=\"_blank\"> https://imgur.com/a/tcn1LD6 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My ideas are bad and I should feel bad.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12157-kvark","name":"Kvark","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"186"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-26T07:32:20-07:00","id":1488022,"title":"","content":"In this case we're looking at Changeling terminology. Beast is one of the Seemings, and Chateleine is a kith for changelings who were given the aspect of houseservants, stewards and maids.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-26T07:38:38-07:00","id":1488023,"title":"","content":"Hmmmm. An Ogre with a human body bent, twisted and deformed until it became vaguely horselike. A Broadback Ogre, basically, turned into a workhorse by a Gentry that fancied himself a farmer.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12219,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","user":"Demigod Beast","date":". 07-26-2022, 11:44 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-26T07:44:06-07:00","i